                                                                        TaskModel.Status
                                                                                .IN_PROGRESS)
                                                        || runningTask.getStatus().isTerminal())
                                .map(TaskModel::getReferenceTaskName)
                                .filter(
                                        refTaskName ->
                                                refTaskName.equals(
                                                        dynForkTask.getTaskReferenceName()))
